OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry with a mixture of
OL,6,Fcloud and bright or sunny spells.
OL,7,FTurning quite blustery at times,
OL,8,Fespecially during the afternoon but
OL,9,Ffeeling warmer than yesterday in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud thickening this evening
OL,13,Fwith the chance of some showery rain,
OL,14,Fmainly across Northumberland and the
OL,15,FPennines. Perhaps some rain edging
OL,16,Ffurther south later. Warmer than
OL,17,Frecent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,165,160,301,260,100,100
