OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F164A1786169895
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FRather cloudy and often dry,
OL,6,Falthough outbreaks of rain are
OL,7,Fpossible. These most likely at first,
OL,8,Fand again into the evening. Cooler
OL,9,Fthan Saturday, but still warm in any
OL,10,Fbrightness.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FSettled and generally dry, with a
OL,14,Fmixture of cloud and sunshine. Turning
OL,15,Fvery warm but also rather breezy at
OL,16,Ftimes in coastal areas and over higher
OL,17,Fground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
